## Security Features

### 1. Password Security
- ✅ Argon2 hashing (memory-hard, GPU-resistant)
- ✅ Strong password requirements enforced
- ✅ Never stored in plain text
- ✅ Unique per user

### 2. JWT Token Security
- ✅ HS256 algorithm for signing
- ✅ 24-hour expiration
- ✅ Signature verification on use
- ✅ User email embedded in token

### 3. Data Validation
- ✅ Email validation (EmailStr)
- ✅ Password strength validation
- ✅ Request payload validation (Pydantic)
- ✅ Type checking

### 4. CORS Configuration
- ✅ Restricted to frontend origin
- ✅ Credentials allowed
- ✅ Specific headers/methods (configurable)

### 5. Error Handling
- ✅ Generic error messages (no info leakage)
- ✅ Proper HTTP status codes
- ✅ Request validation errors
- ✅ Database error handling

### 6. Database
- ✅ SQLite with file encryption support
- ✅ SQLAlchemy ORM (SQL injection protection)
- ✅ Unique email constraint (database-level)
- ✅ Automatic timestamps

### ⚠️ Production Checklist

Before deploying:
- [ ] Change `SECRET_KEY` to a strong random value
- [ ] Update `allow_origins` to your domain
- [ ] Switch database from SQLite to PostgreSQL/MySQL
- [ ] Enable HTTPS
- [ ] Set `DEBUG=False`
- [ ] Use environment-specific `.env` files
- [ ] Implement rate limiting
- [ ] Add logging and monitoring
- [ ] Set up database backups
- [ ] Consider adding refresh tokens

